@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state AccountCreation <<choice>>
state Login <<choice>>
state ApplicationSubmission <<choice>>
state PaymentConfirmation <<choice>>
state ApplicationAcceptance <<choice>>
state StatusView <<choice>>
state StatusCheck <<choice>>
state CancellationRequest <<choice>>
state DetailsModification <<choice>>
state FeedbackGiven <<choice>>
state Logout <<choice>>

AccountCreation:! [*]
Login: AccountCreation --> Login
ApplicationSubmission: Login --> ApplicationSubmission
PaymentConfirmation: ApplicationSubmission --> PaymentConfirmation
ApplicationAcceptance: PaymentConfirmation --> ApplicationAcceptance
StatusView: ApplicationAcceptance --> StatusView
StatusCheck: StatusView --> StatusCheck
CancellationRequest: Login --> CancellationRequest
DetailsModification: Login --> DetailsModification
FeedbackGiven: StatusCheck --> FeedbackGiven
Logout: DetailsModification | FeedbackGiven | ApplicationAcceptance | StatusView | CancellationRequest --> Logout
@enduml
